  "contentHtml": "<p>예전에 이명신선생님께서 암석송을 놀토형식으로 올려주신 것을 수업시간에 해보니 아이들이 너무 재밌게하여</p><p>이번엔 지구계송을 이용하여 제가 만들어보았습니다.</p><p>손재주가없어 많이 허접합니다....ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>암석송은 요 밑 링크를 타고가시면 됩니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1863\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">재미있는 과학수업 만들기 | 암석송 도레미마켓 - Daum 카페</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1863\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=cen&amp;datanum=1863\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1863\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/cen/1863\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4724bd024569c2f2ffcf7af5e286e8fb66c80e04?download\" data-file-name=\"지구계송.zip\" data-file-size=\"5000736\" data-mimetype=\"application/x-zip-compressed\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D924%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20240405080806&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4724bd024569c2f2ffcf7af5e286e8fb66c80e04')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"na